 ('A recessive phenotype','For an autosomal gene with complete dominance of A over a, which genotype has the recessive phenotype?', ['$aa$','$Aa$','$AA$','Both $AA$ and $Aa$'], 'The recessive phenotype is expressed when both alleles are recessive, under the stated complete-dominance model.','sl'),
